                                          1981  # The instructions below are all implemented in the second code page. Jumping
                                          1982  # back and forth makes each 6 cycles slower, but it also saves space in the
                                          1983  # primary page for the instructions above. Most of them are in fact not very
                                          1984  # critical, as evidenced by the fact that they weren't needed for the first
                                          1985  # Gigatron applications (Snake, Racer, Mandelbrot, Loader). By providing them
                                          1986  # in this way, at least they don't need to be implemented as a SYS extension.
                                          1987
