                                          4086  #     $40 RTI -         but gets mapped to #$DD      handled in v6502_mode0
                                          4087  #     $60 RTS -         but gets mapped to #$DD      handled in v6502_mode0
                                          4088  #     $6C JMP ($DDDD)   but gets mapped to $DDDD     handled in v6502_JMP2
                                          4089  #     $96 STX $DD,Y     but gets mapped to $DD,X     handled in v6502_STX2
